    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:892a9a52635d94a61dd5518e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没……事……\r\n只是有些……\r\n“偏头疼”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d907d4a853b8e88c99e6f0ffe37d51bea396638ce3d988dcceb2d72910ab8f2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7f2ac9aacad475924772bd4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——我正在逐渐理解新宇宙的话语。\r\n但与此同时，我无法理解的谜团也在增多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ee931bedf3f1854de79d5a6c5192303972e0e7cb6c96efb14505880b387c67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5086b2aab848386238a1ac9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我将这些小小的谜团藏在心底。\r\n与新宇宙共度的日子，仍在继续。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c690909fa900ee10b7acdb23214943ed109e29b6125772bb4c51905e0aa1e902",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:998d390bbc0ee4069986bdd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有时程度轻微，有时则是阵阵剧痛。\r\n虽从她的表情看不出什么，\r\n但却能通过她的描述觉出她的感受。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62222194acbcaa9a74f6690a5f6b17c9ab159732247e70313b1a5952a03b7209",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b7acd27843823530cf9a3fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随着对她话语的理解度提升，\r\n我也总算明白了一件事——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a7b84375208947ec6373daebc08027b8c257ac32c41cb52e8b6f2629fb3f5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f689f5fd43ff4d8e5c1f669e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66eab759a0e7596b253b5718",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员。新宇宙推荐这个哦——\r\n自冷却向加热的转换。",
      "source_fingerprint": "572ddeb104885a7ed46358c276618f46a28906c94d46d511137303e32c88dc2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddf4866233b653289049fdcc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
