    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a7c20c37498c7fcbf9ebfeb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "眼下已经通过“重力圈”……\r\n如果继续进行冷却的话，会粘滞的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68231305b417d96e483443c7fe90757d77e910d050dfe9d68048fa4be111a714",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cad51fce03e0c5bce92414f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高まる理解、深まる謎",
      "source_fingerprint": "79a9c8ddf6f7ca3cf0e2797cfeca0a7754dd108a84a90c43c2ee82eb9bb7a6ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:257e58b776c56e2b096bd0a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有时，新宇宙能够展现出令人惊叹的探知能力。\r\n而关于这能力的真相，仍是个谜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "157baf910147b2cd74aad8201403990406fe9af3299dba0bba9f09c70f1e8d75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:821dfd8f94b37b9e20d0e898",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙，要去看『菊花赏』吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fd80dbb7693fbc089f659aec4843147b51c59c34d9ead9566e840917a98c842",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "choice_data_list",
