      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa02c6fe0be26c43cf6c8d7f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把这件事情先放在一边，\r\n我们现在仍需脚踏实地地积累经验。\r\n而训练的内容，也不只是“参加比赛”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d61d71e8e7228b15655f1ad8a457a906102930025462d730cebc1491bab4c88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
