    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abf811d73c5fef84c7eb9e21",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，我们来到了京都竞马场。我们看见的是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d66555cb0ffd70563d3bac0f357fcdd713986cb935eabdd402f79e1c90ec70f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
