      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先是最为引人注目的人气第一——\r\n六号选手。是皋月赏赛马娘啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb0543f28aa9503293ed1ac5bcbd3d8093123d367663a6923e79765348b831b1",
