    {
      "uid": "zhcn:277efb6814f103db7583a07a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀～出道战之后就遭遇九连败，\r\n上一场比赛就是我第一次参加重赏赛，\r\n现在又是菊花赏……真是受不了哇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f34f193392af27de2604f6c3e5c9e677fc6d31014aeb25303fb2513ea4a4592",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
