    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fabfec4435bc6849a8d53ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——菱钻奇宝。\r\n坊间对他的评价是……非常普通的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df16c2380496cc0a620e35ded1a79b55b166b2267440bb31814bebecb5c0969d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:579724a3c65f2fe314e93bef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "按照她在这场比赛中的人气排名，\r\n大概能进前三名都算得上奇迹了吧。\r\n（菱钻奇宝的“奇宝”原文便是“奇迹”）",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c0dbf1b4b1bc53a38bccc72a652436b02eb90710d7b5938950e57bffa18b079",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
