    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1530e3b3d2f566c344df3ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……这位赛马娘真的能赢下这场比赛吗？\r\n再说，这可是『菊花赏』啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "66bdb1bd9798ca0c3a49e13e78f2a8b1f024cdbadf1b96cce093f772930d0724",
