      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我本想说“绝无可能”，\r\n但比赛本就是万事皆有可能的世界。\r\n只是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebd2ec4c8a8c150886a96823f264147466f819369361cb088b027823a3097698",
